<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Action Format</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The router’s output is written with the four elements illustrated in
Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.1 Action Format ‣ Appendix A Routing Interface ‣ RouteWeaver: Weaving Mode Selection and Execution into Unified LLM Routing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>: one <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">mode</span> element, followed by <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">route</span>
elements interleaved with environment-inserted <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">observation</span> elements, and a
final <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span> element. Workers are named by their anonymous IDs.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Schematic of the shared trajectory representation.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T4.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T4.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Element</th>
<th id="A1.T4.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Illustrative form</th>
<th id="A1.T4.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Produced by</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T4.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Mode selection</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A1.T4.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;mode&gt;agentic&lt;/mode&gt;</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Router</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Worker call</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">
<table id="A1.T4.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<tr id="A1.T4.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A1.T4.2.3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;route model="worker_2" role="verifier" refs="n1"&gt;</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.2.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"> <span id="A1.T4.2.3.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">  Check the proposed solution.&lt;/route&gt;</span></td></tr>
</table></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Router</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Returned output</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;observation id="n2"&gt;…&lt;/observation&gt;</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Environment</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
