<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Training data.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The router is trained on 3,200 queries from seven datasets
(Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Training data. ‣ B.1 Datasets ‣ Appendix B Experimental Setup ‣ RouteWeaver: Weaving Mode Selection and Execution into Unified LLM Routing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>). Each training batch contains 32 queries with fixed
domain quotas: 7 Math, 7 Code (4 APPS and 3 LiveCodeBench), 6 Knowledge, 7 Reason, and
5 Recall.</p>
</div>
